{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13207420","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13207420","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1320742001:2":{"text":"Wow... Amazing! The melody, it's like I'm seeing pictures!","source_cn":"好、好神奇！只是听着旋律，好像能感受到画面！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC188B7ABCD69053A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320742002:1":{"text":"I can almost make out white birds soaring, antelopes racing across the desert... animals I've only dreamed of.","source_cn":"我好像看见了挥动翅膀的白鸟，在沙漠里奔跑的羚羊……看见...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5AAA5B0ABDC1A3A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320742003:1":{"text":"They're flying, leaping, playing...","source_cn":"它们在飞，在跳，在打闹……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x363FB161883E9F0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320742004:1":{"text":"I wanna reach out to them, to be near them.","source_cn":"我想摸摸他们……想到他们身边去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A2FE0A8628801C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320742005:1":{"text":"And you can totally do that! But first, you have to focus on your treatment. How will you recover if you don't even take the medicine the doctor gives you?","source_cn":"巴维尔……你可以的！但是你要安心治疗，如果连医生给的药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39CDFFCB94424DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320742006:1":{"text":"Do you really think I can? They say this kind of illness is almost impossible to cure... I'm already blind...","source_cn":"我真的能恢复吗……我听说，这种病很难恢复……我已经瞎了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C821673678ED2AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320742007:1":{"text":"But you can see right now, can't you? What determines how you view the world isn't your eyes—it's your heart.","source_cn":"你现在也能看见，不是吗？决定你能否看见风景的，不是你的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x494051649F1DFF60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320742008:1":{"text":"Trust in it, Bavier. Believe in yourself, and one day, I know you'll go on adventures again.","source_cn":"用你的心，相信你的眼睛。你一定可以再次踏上冒险的旅途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A9B993847E4B5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320742009:1":{"text":"My heart...","source_cn":"我的心……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40F69226D0C82D9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320742010:1":{"text":"I understand. I'll try to trust it!","source_cn":"我知道了，我会试着相信它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95ACEB44A60B2EE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320742011:1":{"text":"Thank you, Uncle Lorsan!","source_cn":"洛桑哥哥，谢谢你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0BB98AD85085152","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1320742012:1":{"text":"U-Uncle?! Whoa, whoa, I'm not that old, kiddo! Anyway, we'll totally go adventuring together once you're better. But first, you have to get well, alright?","source_cn":"等你康复了，说不定我们还有机会一起去冒险呢，一定要好起来啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4463D8B22D6ABFFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1320742013:1":{"text":"Yes!","source_cn":"嗯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D6558626784D6C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1320742014:1":{"text":"Over the next few days, Lorsan plays enchanting melodies with the luminite—a quirky, yet ingenious creation only he could dream up.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x800378BC80B3F28E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1320742015:1":{"text":"A few days later...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5ADC8B71D8833C9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:巴维尔":{"text":"Bavier","source":"巴维尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:娜杰卡":{"text":"Nadeen","source":"娜杰卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"Lorsan","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"Black Screen","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":16,"localized_text_count":15,"speaker_count":4}}